course: dictionary
lesson: 12784
title: Working well without waste
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Efficient» describes something that works well and does not waste time, energy, money or materials. «The new fan is very efficient.» If a fan is efficient, it moves plenty of air without using lots of electricity.
explain: Efficient can also describe a person. «Sam is efficient at his job; he finishes every task quickly and well.» The clues are finishes quickly and well, so efficient means good at getting work done.
explain: Efficient can describe a method too. «Using times tables is an efficient way to find the answer.» The clue is the answer comes in fewer steps, not by counting one by one. When you meet efficient, ask: did this waste anything?
fact: «Efficient» means working well without wasting time, energy, money or materials.
fact: «Efficiently» is the adverb: she works efficiently when she plans her day.
fact: «Efficiency» is the noun: the efficiency of a machine means how little energy it wastes.
fact: An «energy-efficient» light bulb turns most of its energy into light, not heat.
fact: In maths, an efficient method gets the answer in fewer steps.
exercise: «The LED bulb is more efficient than the old bulb.» What does efficient mean here? | Is the oldest bulb | *Wastes little energy | Makes the most noise | Uses the most energy
exercise: Anya uses times tables to answer quickly. Why is this efficient? | *It gets the answer in fewer steps | It makes the answer wrong | It is slower than counting | It uses more paper
exercise: Find and copy the word that describes a worker who gets jobs done quickly and well. | noisy | sleepy | *efficient | lazy
test: «Mo works efficiently, so he tidies his room in ten minutes.» What does efficiently mean? | Slowly and with lots of mistakes | Without any tidying at all | Loudly, so everyone hears | *In a way that wastes no time or effort
test: «A fuel-efficient car uses little petrol for each kilometre.» What does fuel-efficient suggest? | It is only for boats | It has no engine | *It wastes little fuel | It uses the most petrol
exam: Which word is the noun form of efficient? | *efficiency | efficiented | efficiently | efficient
